WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to SOMA!

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.460
I've been like, dying to play this game by the way.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.300
And in case you guys didn't know, I'm super s-

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:08.820
Hello!

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.180
What's this?

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:11.680
Hello!

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.340
HI, little buddy!

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.680
Should I free you? Probably not.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.440
Do you have a gun?

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.340
Is that a gun?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.960
Don't shoot me

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:21.700
Okay, bye!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.540
Am I supposed to follow you?

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.740
Are you following me?

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.980
Thanks, little buddy!

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:28.980
I like you.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.120
I wanna name you.. *thinks*

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.960
"Tiny.. Sub..."

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.300
...

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.140
"Tim."

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.320
Damnit, gah, gotta be more original than that [chuckle]

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.880
I can't just name him Tim! I can't name everything Tim!

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:40.920
Ah..

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.960
I'm gonna name you "Bubble Butt"!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.300
'Cause I like you!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.140
'Cause you- you- you- you shoot bubbles out your butt and I like that.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:48.720
[fart noise] *pbff*

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.100
*ding*

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.120
'Kay, so I gotta get in there.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.160
C'mon Bubble Butt! You wanna come inside?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.940
Bu-bble, Bubble Butt's all excited!

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:56.820
*ffffffff*

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.420
Okay!

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.140
*fffffff*

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.840
Bubble Butt sure is nice! Look at Bubble Butt helping me out!

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.000
Thanks, Bubble Butt!

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.000
AWW, thanks, Bubble Butt!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.020
BYEEE! [very loud noise in background]

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:06.540
Have a good time, Bubble Butt!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.280
I'll see ya around!

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.000
...Hopefully.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.820
*demon/ghoul screech of sorts*

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:10.740
AHHHH!

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.620
WHAT THE FUCK!?!! AHHHHH!!!

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.620
OH GOD!

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.040
*robo noise*

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.140
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back to SOMA!

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.740
[sound of machine buzzing intensifying, crash]

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.940
[chuckling] hehehehehe

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.760
[alarm siren going off]

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.060
[speaker] "Brace for impact!"

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.180
Ohhhh!

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:36.420
[female voice on speaker] "Hold on, the blank just pushes all the blanch out!"

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.360
[male voice on speaker] "What does that mean?!"

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.840
[female voice again] "If I don't hit Delta, we're dead."

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:40.740
Yay!

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:43.040
[distanced crashing sounds]

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.040
"I'll never get this open"

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.460
WHY? You don't need to be such a pessimist about things, you can do it!

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.800
Believe in yourself! You're a roo-

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:52.980
Bubble Butt!!

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.800
[excited and joyous] Is that Bubble Butt?!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:59.360
[ecstatic] Oh my god, is that Bubble Butt coming to rescue me???!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.840
[quiet hope] Is that Bubble Butt?

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.480
Bubble- BUBBLE BUTT!!

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.420
OH, it's Bubble Butt!!

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:06.260
Oh my god!!

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.500
Thanks, Bubble Butt!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.820
You're the best!

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.100
[excited] Oh my gosh, are you going to be following me around now?

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.320
Oh, you're so cute!

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.460
I love you, Bubble Butt!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.780
Always will!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.000
Like I said, you're my little Bubble Blow and Bubble Butt Biscuit!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.840
[gushing] Oh, you're so cute!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:24.000
[screen] "The tool chip is busted, we need to get a new tool chip, then switch it."

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:24.620
Okay.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.360
[screen] "I think it would be easier to just take one from a robot."

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.280
"The toolbox over there says it has a stun-baton, you can use that."

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.440
I am not knocking out Bubble Butt!

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:37.720
I am NOT... knocking out... Bubble Butt.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.040
[whining] I don't wanna hurt Bubble Butt!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.180
I'm sorry!

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.140
[sound of shot and crashing]

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.240
[another crash]

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.340
I feel like a bad man!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.080
But at least Bubble Butt's still here!

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.400
Noo, Bubble Butt, don't run away from me!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.060
Bubble Butt!

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.420
[teary] Bubble Butt, I'm sorry!

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.680
I had to!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:05.600
[sobs] NoOoOoOoo, Bubble Butt!

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.800
[sounds of agony mixed with crying]

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.460
[sobs slowly fade out]

